---
// Fast fault current injection, qualitatively: extra reactive current grows
// as voltage falls below 0.9 pu, capped by the converter's current rating.
// Who gets priority when the cap bites differs: GB & NI reactive, IE active.
// Shape only — the gain and limits come from each code's figures.
---

<div class="ff">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 230" class="fg-svg ff__svg" role="img"
    aria-label="Sketch: additional reactive current rises as voltage falls below 0.9 per unit, up to the current limit">
    <line x1="60" y1="190" x2="580" y2="190" stroke="var(--color-text-muted)" />
    <line x1="60" y1="20" x2="60" y2="190" stroke="var(--color-text-muted)" />
    <text x="320" y="222" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" class="fg-svg__muted">voltage at the measurement point (pu)</text>
    <text x="16" y="105" font-size="11" class="fg-svg__muted" transform="rotate(-90 16 105)" text-anchor="middle">extra reactive current</text>
    <text x="60" y="205" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-svg__muted">0</text>
    <text x="476" y="205" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-svg__muted">0.9</text>
    <text x="545" y="205" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-svg__muted">1.0</text>
    <rect x="476" y="20" width="104" height="170" fill="var(--color-bg-grid)" opacity="0.6" />
    <text x="528" y="40" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-svg__muted">normal band</text>
    <line x1="60" y1="50" x2="580" y2="50" stroke="var(--fg-bad)" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
    <text x="66" y="44" font-size="10" fill="var(--fg-bad)">converter current limit</text>
    <path d="M476,190 L260,50 L60,50" fill="none" stroke="var(--fg-gb)" stroke-width="2.6" />
    <text x="300" y="112" font-size="11" fill="var(--fg-gb)">rises as the dip deepens</text>
  </svg>
  <div class="ff__cols">
    <div class="ff__col ff__col--gb"><strong>GB · NI</strong> Reactive current first. Active power may be cut to make room within the current limit.</div>
    <div class="ff__col ff__col--ie"><strong>Ireland</strong> Active power first; reactive current at least proportional to the dip. Rise ≤100 ms, settle ≤300 ms (IE &amp; NI).</div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ff__svg {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .ff__cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 220px), 1fr));
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .ff__col {
    --tone: var(--fg-other);

    border-left: 4px solid var(--tone);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem;
    background: var(--fg-card);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .ff__col strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--tone);
  }

  .ff__col--gb { --tone: var(--fg-gb); }

  .ff__col--ie { --tone: var(--fg-ie); }
</style>
